WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.699
Stage 1 starts by preparing:

2
00:00:01.699 --> 00:00:05.593
the group managed account's retriever
group with the test host in it,

3
00:00:05.593 --> 00:00:09.973
and the synthetic objects, an app with
two owners and a federated credential,

4
00:00:09.973 --> 00:00:13.450
and a service account whose
random password nobody records.

5
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.362
The pilot's policy is created, turned off.

6
00:00:16.362 --> 00:00:21.425
The preflight records the validation
kit's baseline, checks one to ten;

7
00:00:21.425 --> 00:00:26.400
check ten, for AWS GovCloud and O C I,
doesn't apply in this Entra runbook.

8
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.362
And it checks the root key
is more than ten hours old.

9
00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:32.776
Step 1.1 reads every
identity and its owners.

10
00:00:32.776 --> 00:00:36.141
Step 1.2 turns the pilot
policy on for just two apps,

11
00:00:36.141 --> 00:00:38.850
and plans the tenant-wide one for review.

12
00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:42.267
Step 1.3 moves the pilot
to a federated credential

13
00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:45.360
and a managed identity,
beside its old secret.
